          "body": "Some Azzurri took part in the Captain's Run at Genoa's Stadio Luigi Ferraris on the eve of the Argentina test, then visited the Monte Contessa municipal shelter. Head coach Gonzalo Quesada, municipal councillor Francesca Ghio and shelter volunteers posed with some of the animals as part of the city's adopt, don't buy campaign, which the players helped relaunch. The Federazione Italiana Rugby, working with Genoa city council, presents the visit as part of its social responsibility work."
