          "heading": "Dave Rennie says All Blacks will target Wales flanker Jac Morgan",
          "body": "New Zealand head coach Dave Rennie says the All Blacks have discussed how to neutralise Wales flanker Jac Morgan, whose contact-area work New Zealand regard as one of Wales' main strengths. Ahead of Saturday's Test at the Principality Stadium, Rennie said we're well aware of that and we'll have a focus on eliminating him before he can cause us stress. Rennie also said the All Blacks must not let Wales scrum-half Tomos Williams have too much space, given his kicking game."
